The copied prelude/protocol/identifier are unmodified except removal of source-map
comments. The host execution implementation has a relative import adjustment and
waits for pending native admission before stopping/settling, to join native workers. Stop/join rejection becomes a sandbox failure.

The vendored host implementation is exposed through Pi's public TypeScript base
interface. It is not an instanceof the upstream runtime class. No unexported Pi
runtime path, WASM launcher, or Node builtin is imported by the mobile entry point.
